# ops-observations/ — local-only telemetry. Only upgrade-candidates.md
# is safe to commit (anonymised summary of plugin-level signals).
#
# Everything else is excluded by default to prevent accidental commit
# of chapter-specific or session-specific data.

rawlog.jsonl
chapter-*-process-notes.md
chapter-*-content-notes.md
transcripts/

# But DO commit the templates that ship with the plugin (they have N
# literally in the filename, not a digit).
!section-N-process-notes.md
!section-N-content-notes.md
